I come out of the shop.
I remember Kaka's words.
"Turn right from the corner and go straight."
I walk to the next corner.
There, I turn right.
I walk absolutely straight.
This road goes towards the sea.
There are tall buildings on both sides of the street.
I go straight ahead.
Suddenly, the buildings end.
I feel a cool breeze on my face.
The blue sea is in front.
I finally reach Marine Drive.
The promenade here is very wide.
I step onto this wide promenade.
I look towards the sea again.
I take a deep breath.
Now I know the way for sure.
I feel very happy.
